pecify the observable behavior being compared.\"\n\n    design_decisions:\n      - id: D1\n        text: \"Follow the PRD structure and granularity established by prd020-true.yaml as the closest sibling utility. If prd020-true.yaml is not available, follow prd006-cat.yaml structure.\"\n      - id: D2\n        text: \"Reference binary is gfalse from Homebrew coreutils (ARCHITECTURE.yaml DD4). All differential tests run under LC_ALL=C (ARCHITECTURE.yaml DD6).\"\n      - id: D3\n        text: \"The implementation target is cmd/false/main.go with differential tests in cmd/false/false_test.go, following the cmd/ package-per-utility pattern from ARCHITECTURE.yaml.\"\n\n    acceptance_criteria:\n      - id: AC1\n        text: \"File docs/specs/product-requirements/prd021-false.yaml exists and is valid YAML\"\n      - id: AC2\n        text: \"PRD contains all required sections: Problem, Goals, Requirements, Non-Goals, and Acceptance Criteria\"\n      - id: AC3\n        text: \"Every requirement has a unique sequential ID (R1, R2, ...) and maps to observable GNU false behavior derived from C source analysis\"\n      - id: AC4\n        text: \"Acceptance criteria are verifiable via differential testing against gfalse and reference specific requirement IDs\"\n```","stop_reason":null,"session_id":"3c151bc4-25c1-4526-8e22-6fdafae9e6ea","total_cost_usd":0.65121075,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":86465,"cache_read_input_tokens":19289,"output_tokens":4046,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":86465,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-opus-4-6":{"inputTokens":2,"outputTokens":4046,"cacheReadInputTokens":19289,"cacheCreationInputTokens":86465,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.65121075,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000}},"permission_denials":[],"uuid":"6010ed1f-f7e6-4d3c-8310-1b